{'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4ODUzMjAxNzUxNzc5NDUwODg=', 'text': "This is, at its core, an 'unscientific' statement--the claim about 'settled science'. \n\nAs a professor/scientist, I always teach my students: science is the pursuit of truth. We are simply seeking to understand the world, and we do this by constantly challenging our assumptions. In fact, we're actively trying to prove them wrong!\n\nBecause of this, we must be ready, at any moment, to put aside everything what we thought we knew. \n\nIf we think an idea is 'settled' in science, we've stopped being a scientist.", 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': [{'from_index': 289, 'to_index': 330, 'richtext_types': ['Bold']}]}, 'media': {'inline_media': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 21, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Fri Jan 31 13:32:11 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1885020473618055460', 'display_text_range': [14, 293], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '69156861', 'name': 'Chief Nerd', 'screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'indices': [0, 13]}]}, 'favorite_count': 407, 'favorited': False, 'full_text': "@TheChiefNerd This is, at its core, an 'unscientific' statement--the claim about 'settled science'. \n\nAs a professor/scientist, I always teach my students: science is the pursuit of truth. We are simply seeking to understand the world, and we do this by constantly challenging our assumptions.", 'in_reply_to_screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'in_reply_to_status_id_str': '1885020473618055460', 'in_reply_to_user_id_str': '69156861', 'is_quote_status': False, 'lang': 'en', 'quote_count': 4, 'reply_count': 24, 'retweet_count': 66, 'retweeted': False, 'user_id_str': '4643465352', 'id_str': '1885320175261802927'}}, '_legacy': {'bookmark_count': 21, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Fri Jan 31 13:32:11 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1885020473618055460', 'dis